  "2026-08-17T05:22:04.127Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: portable numeric errno fixtures pass 74/74 focused tests; full repository coverage passed 7,459 tests at exact 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines; typecheck, security scan, repository quality gates, SDK entrypoint performance, and CLI transport floor passed locally. Runtime lookup now excludes missing/non-integral platform constants while Linux retains EDQUOT coverage and Windows selects declared ENOSPC. Hosted Windows Node 24 is required on the delivery PR."
